      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bingham_Farms%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1844 a railroad ran between Detroit and Pontiac, linking Bingham Farms to the growing regional economy.",
